    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83c\udf44UPDATES &amp; ANNOUNCEMENTS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/ddd65dda8e447b3a8e99be6a22544c7c.poster.avif?t=1749653568\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/ddd65dda8e447b3a8e99be6a22544c7c.webm?t=1749653568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/ddd65dda8e447b3a8e99be6a22544c7c.mp4?t=1749653568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/ad9e99c4b3d12790d6b9be89b57070d1.avif?t=1749653568\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new infectious disease is threatening the well-being of not only the population of Spain, but the whole world \u2014 and it's the job of the Plague Control Department to contain it, investigate it, and find a cure. You'll walk in the shoes of Hugo, a newly recruited officer forced into action, who joins a team of peculiar individuals. With a partner who's &quot;difficult to work with,&quot; he'll have to face the reality that this new infection is more dangerous than previously thought, uncovering a conspiracy that may involve forces far greater than himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/3d9360e0d3bf33b10a35d13654cdbd09.poster.avif?t=1749653568\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/3d9360e0d3bf33b10a35d13654cdbd09.webp?t=1749653568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=238 /></picture></span><br>\ud83c\udf44Explore and collect clues\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/9fe383dccdda61a66270522e416b2cfe.avif?t=1749653568\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83c\udf44Survive dangerous environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/bd4ca9c82d68a03e01b4cb18e05a60a7.poster.avif?t=1749653568\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/bd4ca9c82d68a03e01b4cb18e05a60a7.webm?t=1749653568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/bd4ca9c82d68a03e01b4cb18e05a60a7.mp4?t=1749653568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udf44Meet interesting characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/4422cee625c2a59ebfd4b349db17914b.avif?t=1749653568\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44Solve the mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/ad9e99c4b3d12790d6b9be89b57070d1.avif?t=1749653568\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new infectious disease is threatening the well-being of not only the population of Spain, but the whole world \u2014 and it's the job of the Plague Control Department to contain it, investigate it, and find a cure. You'll walk in the shoes of Hugo, a newly recruited officer forced into action, who joins a team of peculiar individuals. With a partner who's &quot;difficult to work with,&quot; he'll have to face the reality that this new infection is more dangerous than previously thought, uncovering a conspiracy that may involve forces far greater than himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/3d9360e0d3bf33b10a35d13654cdbd09.poster.avif?t=1749653568\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/3d9360e0d3bf33b10a35d13654cdbd09.webp?t=1749653568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=238 /></picture></span><br>\ud83c\udf44Explore and collect clues\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/9fe383dccdda61a66270522e416b2cfe.avif?t=1749653568\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83c\udf44Survive dangerous environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/bd4ca9c82d68a03e01b4cb18e05a60a7.poster.avif?t=1749653568\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/bd4ca9c82d68a03e01b4cb18e05a60a7.webm?t=1749653568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/bd4ca9c82d68a03e01b4cb18e05a60a7.mp4?t=1749653568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udf44Meet interesting characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785860/extras/4422cee625c2a59ebfd4b349db17914b.avif?t=1749653568\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44Solve the mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p>",
